    "done_when": "The profile in ~/.config/reckon/crew/reports/reckon/complete-profile.md  measured _plan_html.read_state (reckon/_plan_html.py:482) at 35 percent of an 81.9 s promotion, mostly reached through metadata_index._plan_record (reckon/metadata_index.py:411) over all 205 plan and doc files. The index keeps each file's parsed record keyed by its content digest, or by mtime and size with a digest check, and re-parses only a changed file. Its output equals a full rebuild. A new tests/test_the_metadata_index_reuses_unchanged_plans.py builds the index twice over a synthetic docs tree, changes one file, and asserts that only that file is re-read and that the result equals a cold build. The declared negative control is executed and logged. Base and head arms of every test file that imports reckon.metadata_index show zero added failures.",
